%% Trigger.dev Data Flow: Task Trigger → Execution → Completion
%% Analysis Commit: 19fa66931819371d607eff001b561aa783547734

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Developer's App
    participant SDK as @trigger.dev/sdk
    participant API as Webapp API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Queue as Redis Queue
    participant Engine as RunEngine
    participant Coord as Coordinator
    participant Worker as Worker (Docker/K8s)
    participant WS as WebSocket

    Note over User,WS: Phase 1: Task Triggering

    User->>SDK: await myTask.trigger(payload)
    SDK->>API: POST /api/v1/tasks/my-task/trigger<br/>{payload, options}
    API->>API: Validate API key & payload
    API->>DB: Create TaskRun<br/>(status: PENDING)
    DB-->>API: run_abc123
    API->>Queue: ZADD queue run_abc123
    API->>WS: Emit "run:created"
    WS-->>User: Real-time notification
    API-->>SDK: {id: "run_abc123", status: "PENDING"}
    SDK-->>User: RunHandle

    Note over User,WS: Phase 2: Dequeuing & Assignment

    Engine->>Queue: ZRANGE queue 0 0 (get next run)
    Queue-->>Engine: run_abc123
    Engine->>Engine: Acquire lock (Redis SET NX)
    Engine->>DB: Update status: PENDING → STARTED
    Engine->>DB: Create TaskRunAttempt #1
    Engine->>Coord: assignTask(run_abc123)
    Coord->>Coord: Find available worker
    Coord->>Worker: Execute task<br/>{runId, payload, context}
    Engine->>WS: Emit "run:started"
    WS-->>User: Real-time update

    Note over User,WS: Phase 3: Execution (with Checkpoint)

    Worker->>Worker: Start task execution
    Worker->>DB: Update status: STARTED → EXECUTING
    Worker->>WS: Stream logs
    WS-->>User: Live log updates

    Worker->>Worker: Execute step 1 (10 minutes)
    Worker->>Worker: await ctx.checkpoint("step1")
    Worker->>Coord: Request checkpoint
    Coord->>Engine: saveCheckpoint("step1", state)
    Engine->>DB: Create TaskRunCheckpoint<br/>{name: "step1", state: {...}}
    Engine->>DB: Update status: EXECUTING → WAITING
    Engine->>WS: Emit "run:checkpointed"
    Worker->>Worker: Release resources

    Note over User,WS: Phase 4: Resume from Checkpoint

    Engine->>DB: Find runs in WAITING status
    Engine->>DB: Get latest checkpoint
    Engine->>Queue: Enqueue run_abc123 (resume)
    Engine->>Coord: resumeTask(run_abc123, checkpoint)
    Coord->>Worker: Resume execution<br/>{checkpointId, state}
    Worker->>DB: Update status: WAITING → EXECUTING
    Worker->>Worker: Restore state from checkpoint
    Worker->>Worker: Execute step 2 (2 hours)
    Worker->>Worker: await ctx.checkpoint("step2")
    Coord->>Engine: saveCheckpoint("step2", state)

    Note over User,WS: Phase 5: Completion

    Worker->>Worker: Complete execution
    Worker->>Coord: Report success<br/>{output: {...}}
    Coord->>Engine: completeRun(run_abc123, output)
    Engine->>DB: Update status: EXECUTING → COMPLETED_SUCCESSFULLY
    Engine->>DB: Save output
    Engine->>DB: Update TaskRunAttempt (success)
    Engine->>WS: Emit "run:completed"
    WS-->>User: Final notification
    User->>SDK: await runs.retrieve(run_abc123)
    SDK->>API: GET /api/v1/runs/run_abc123
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM TaskRun
    DB-->>API: {status: "COMPLETED_SUCCESSFULLY", output: {...}}
    API-->>SDK: RunResult
    SDK-->>User: {ok: true, output: {...}}

    Note over User,WS: Phase 6: Analytics & Observability

    Engine->>DB: Write TaskEvent records
    DB->>DB: Partition cleanup (pg_partman)
    DB-->>Queue: Stream CDC events
    Queue-->>CLICKHOUSE: Write analytics data

    Note over User,WS: Optional: Error & Retry Flow

    rect rgb(255, 200, 200)
        Note over Worker,Engine: If task fails
        Worker->>Coord: Report error<br/>{error: {...}}
        Coord->>Engine: failRun(run_abc123, error)
        Engine->>Engine: Check retry config
        alt Attempts < maxAttempts
            Engine->>Engine: Calculate backoff delay
            Engine->>DB: Create TaskRunAttempt #2
            Engine->>Queue: Re-enqueue (delayed)
            Engine->>WS: Emit "run:retry"
        else Max attempts reached
            Engine->>DB: Update status: FAILED
            Engine->>WS: Emit "run:failed"
            Engine->>Engine: Trigger onFailure hooks
        end
    end
